research/raw-data/source-type-migration.md

# raw/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Those captures are the evidence base for every quoted
# claim: they are what `verbatim-not-in-raw` checks against and what survives a dead URL.
# Extracted text only, Class B sources only — see wiki/meta/attributes.md "Raw captures".

